AssociativeAlgebras -- Noncommutative algebra computations
**********************************************************

Description
===========

This code is in active development.  Currently 2-sided Groebner bases (up to
some degree) are implemented, and most features of *note NCAlgebra:
(NCAlgebra)Top, are available.  The package NCAlgebra uses curly braces to
define non-commutative rings whereas this package uses angle bar lists.

This package implements natively (i.e., in the Macaulay2 engine)
non-commutative rings (associative algebras), their (2-sided) Groebner bases,
bases, and a number of other features.

