NCReductionTwoSided -- Reduces the entries of an Matrix with respect to an ideal
********************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        L = NCReductionTwoSided(M,I)
  * Inputs:
      * M, a *note matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,, 
      * I, an *note ideal: (Macaulay2Doc)Ideal,, 
  * Outputs:
      * L, a *note matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,, 

Description
===========

This command reduces the entries of a RingElement or Matrix with respect to an
Ideal or a single row matrix.  A Groebner basis is not computed for the input
ideal.  If one wishes to use this function for normal forms, one must first
call *note NCGB: NCGB, and pass the result to this function.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : A = QQ<|x,y,z|>                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = A                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : FreeAlgebra                                                             |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : f = y*z + z*y - x^2                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|        2                                                                    |
|o2 = - x  + y*z + z*y                                                        |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : A                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : g = x*z + z*x - y^2                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|            2                                                                |
|o3 = x*z - y  + z*x                                                          |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : A                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : h = z^2 - x*y - y*x                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|                    2                                                        |
|o4 = - x*y - y*x + z                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : A                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : I = ideal {f,g,h}                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|               2                     2                       2               |
|o5 = ideal (- x  + y*z + z*y, x*z - y  + z*x, - x*y - y*x + z )              |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : Ideal of A                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : Igb = NCGB(I,10)                                                        |
|Warning:  F4 Algorithm not available over current coefficient ring or        |
|Converting to Naive algorithm.                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o6 = | x2-yz-zy xz-y2+zx xy+yx-z2 yz2-z2y y2z-zy2 |                          |
|                                                                             |
|             1      5                                                        |
|o6 : Matrix A  <-- A                                                         |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|inhomogeneous ideal.                                                         |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : NCReductionTwoSided(x^4,I)                                              |
|                                                                             |
|                  2       2                                                  |
|o7 = y*z*y*z + y*z y + z*y z + z*y*z*y                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o7 : A                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : NCReductionTwoSided(x^4,Igb)                                            |
|                                                                             |
|                           2 2                                               |
|o8 = y*z*y*z + z*y*z*y + 2z y                                                |
|                                                                             |
|o8 : A                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

