=========================

  * "oreExtension(Ring,RingMap,Derivation,RingElement)"
  * "oreExtension(Ring,RingMap,Derivation,Symbol)"
  * "oreExtension(Ring,RingMap,RingElement)"
  * "oreExtension(Ring,RingMap,Symbol)"

