qTensorProduct -- Define the (q-)commuting tensor product
*********************************************************

  * Usage: 
        C = qTensorProduct(A,B,q)
  * Inputs:
      * A, a *note ring: (Macaulay2Doc)Ring,, 
      * B, a *note ring: (Macaulay2Doc)Ring,, 
      * q, a *note ring element: (Macaulay2Doc)RingElement,, 
  * Outputs:
      * C, a *note quotient of a free algebra: FreeAlgebra / Ideal,, 

Description
===========

This function returns the algebra that contains A and B as a subalgebra, with
the commutation law on the images of A and B given by a*b = q*b*a for all a in
A and b in B. In the case of A ** B, q = 1.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : A = QQ<|x,y|>                                                           |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = A                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : FreeAlgebra                                                             |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : B = skewPolynomialRing(QQ,(-1)_QQ, {a,b})                               |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = B                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : FreeAlgebraQuotient                                                     |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : C = qTensorProduct(A,B,-1_QQ)                                           |
|Warning:  F4 Algorithm not available over current coefficient ring or        |
|Converting to Naive algorithm.                                               |
|Warning:  F4 Algorithm not available over current coefficient ring or        |
|Converting to Naive algorithm.                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = C                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : FreeAlgebraQuotient                                                     |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|inhomogeneous ideal.                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|inhomogeneous ideal.                                                         |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : ideal C                                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = ideal (a*b + b*a, x*a + a*x, x*b + b*x, y*a + a*y, y*b + b*y)           |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : Ideal of QQ <|x, y, a, b|>                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : D = A ** B                                                              |
|Warning:  F4 Algorithm not available over current coefficient ring or        |
|Converting to Naive algorithm.                                               |
|Warning:  F4 Algorithm not available over current coefficient ring or        |
|Converting to Naive algorithm.                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = D                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : FreeAlgebraQuotient                                                     |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|inhomogeneous ideal.                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|inhomogeneous ideal.                                                         |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : ideal D                                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o6 = ideal (a*b + b*a, - x*a + a*x, - x*b + b*x, - y*a + a*y, - y*b + b*y)   |
|                                                                             |
|o6 : Ideal of QQ <|x, y, a, b|>                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

